Package: birthdayvoter
Type: Project
Title: Birthday Voter
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jake", "Leland", role = "aut"),
    person("Gaurav", "Sood", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "gsood07@gmail.com"))
Description: Data, analyses, and manuscript for a paper estimating whether
    registered voters are more likely to vote when Election Day falls on
    their birthday, using state voter files from Florida, Ohio,
    Pennsylvania, and Washington.
